# CODEOWNERS — viavitae-infra ownership mapping
#
# Sole-owner model. Four-eyes review is enforced through branch protection
# (required approving reviewer: @IterVitae), not through multi-team CODEOWNERS.
#
# WHY USER HANDLES AND NOT TEAMS — read before editing this file
#   Every owner named here must resolve. GitHub rejects a CODEOWNERS principal
#   that does not exist or that lacks write access to THIS repository, and an
#   unresolved owner silently removes a required reviewer while the file still
#   looks authoritative. The six organisation teams (architects, platform,
#   security, compliance, dpo, legal) do exist, but they are 'closed' and are
#   granted access only to viavitae-brand, so all 34 rules that named them
#   resolved to 'Unknown owner' here. '@Via-Vitae' on its own is an organisation
#   handle, which is not a valid principal either. Do not reintroduce either form.
#   Verify after any change — this must report zero errors:
#     gh api repos/Via-Vitae/viavitae-infra/codeowners/errors
#
# RESIDUAL RISK — see docs/adr/ADR-000-governance-sole-owner-four-eyes.md
#   @IterVitae is named as the independent reviewer but currently has no access
#   to this repository, so GitHub still reports those entries as unknown and an
#   approval from @IterVitae cannot satisfy the required-review count. Until
#   @IterVitae holds write access, four-eyes review is documented but not
#   mechanically enforceable. That gap is recorded as an accepted risk in
#   ADR-000 rather than papered over here.
#
# The path rules below all resolve to the same two handles today. They are kept
# because they record which paths are security- and privacy-sensitive, and so that
# review routing already exists when a second reviewer with write access arrives.

# --- Default owner -----------------------------------------------------------
*                                       @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae

# --- Platform: CI/CD and workflows ------------------------------------------
/.github/                               @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/.github/workflows/                     @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/.github/dependabot.yml                 @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae

# --- Infrastructure source (all IaC is security-sensitive) ------------------
/terraform/                             @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/ansible/                               @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/k8s/                                   @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/.sops.yaml                             @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae

# --- Monitoring and backup ---------------------------------------------------
/monitoring/                            @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/backup/                                @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae

# --- Compliance and privacy --------------------------------------------------
/docs/                                  @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/docs/DPIA-*.md                         @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/docs/architecture.md                   @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae

# --- Legal and policy --------------------------------------------------------
/LICENSE                                @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/SECURITY.md                            @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/CONTRIBUTING.md                        @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/QODER.md                               @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/CHANGELOG.md                           @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
/README.md                              @JourneyOfLife @IterVitae
